  "changes": [
    "Exact-name indexes and per-input alias memoization replace repeated full-library searches",
    "Pinned card metadata is embedded once and validated synchronously, removing normal-path card-data HTTP and IndexedDB",
    "Successful artwork URLs are reused from memory or optional bounded IndexedDB; concurrent downloads are shared",
    "Font readiness overlaps image preparation; image work runs outside Angular change detection",
    "Initial publication reuses its serialized/decoded snapshot pair",
    "Decorative deck/discard piles render at most three representative layers without changing full card lists, counts or action indices",
    "Loading logo is local (300px PNG, 17403 bytes), eliminating its extra remote request",
    "Known iframe fallback echoes no longer trigger another Angular update, and full-state debug logging is removed",
    "Both English tpci and Japanese tpc scans use the existing allowlisted same-origin proxy"
